\par\par \b \uc2  Thai c. bank says no baht  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 309 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Januar 2000\par 09:21\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BANGKOK, Jan 4 (Reuters) - The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Tuesday it would not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to influence the baht's movement despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's sharp rise and it would allow it to fluctuate according to market forces. \par \par \uc2  "We would like to confirm that we will not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market and will let (the baht) move according to market forces. If we take any action, it would probably add to the baht's volatility, something which the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not want to see," said assistant \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Chetthavee Charoenpitaks. \par \par \uc2  The Thai baht rose to a high of 36.83 on Tuesday, from 37.40/37.50 at the end of December. \par \par \uc2  Chetthavee told reporters the baht's rally on Tuesday reflected market confidence in the stability of the Thai economy and a smooth rollover into the new year by the financial sector and the stock market without any computer bug problems. \par \par \uc2  He said the baht benefited from recent projections by the state think tank, the National Economic and Social Development Board, that Thailand's gross domestic product would expand about 4.4 percent in 2000. \par \par \uc2  Chetthavee said a high year-end demand for baht from both domestic and offshore markets, made through the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swap window, would not have much impact on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  this month when market participants unwound positions made with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's net forward swap position stood at more than $4.5 billion at the end of December, up from $4.3 billion a week earlier," Chetthavee said. "The swap deals would not affect the baht as they are spread out over one to three-months maturity." \par \par \uc2  ((Vithoon Amorn, Bangkok newsroom 662-6375500 ext 412 \par \par \uc2  e-mail: bangkok.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 2000. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010822dw1401k26\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
