\par\par \b \uc2  Thai Ctrl Bk: Thai Baht Strengthens On Export Growth \b0\par\par\uc2 255 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Oktober 1999\par 07:03\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK -(Dow Jones)- Thailand's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor said Wednesday that the recent strength in the baht was due to strong export growth. \par \par \uc2  Chatu Mongol Sonakul told reporters that exports grew by 10% on year in September. \par \par \uc2  Exports grew by 15% on year in August, helping Thailand to maintain a hefty trade surplus of 746 million baht. Official figures from the Bank of Thailand for September are due Friday. \par \par \uc2  At 0426 GMT (12:26 a.m. EDT), the dollar was at THB38.615 down from THB38.69 at Tuesday's close and much lower than highs of just below THB41.70 last month. \par \par \uc2  Thai exports remained strong in September because of baht weakness at that time, making locally-produced goods more competitive overseas. \par \par \uc2  Chatu Mongol said baht strength was also due to the unwinding of long-dollar positions in the forwards market. \par \par \uc2  Offshore investors had bet on further declines in the baht last month by borrowing the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy dollars, hoping to sell them later at a higher price. \par \par \uc2  A combination of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar selling to slow the baht's decline, and a tightening of restrictions on baht lending to offshore investors, helped stem the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's decline. \par \par \uc2  Investors subsequently unwound exposure to long-dollar positions, helping to push the baht higher. \par \par \uc2  Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's governor said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  hadn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market recently, without elaborating. \par \par \uc2  -By Suttinee Yuvejwattana; 662-266-0744; suttinee.yuvejwattana@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dvar07nyp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
