\par\par \b \uc2  Thai Baht Down Midday But Off Low On Exporter Dlr Sales \b0\par\par\uc2 295 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 September 1999\par 07:51\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK (Dow Jones)--The Thai baht is lower against the dollar in Asian spot trading midday Tuesday, but local exporter dollar sales put a cap on an early rise by the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , traders said. \par \par \uc2  Around 0504 GMT (1:04 a.m. EDT), the dollar was at 41.335 baht, up from THB40.745 at Monday's Asian close. \par \par \uc2  A foreign bank dealer said exporters responded to the dollar's rally by moving their sell orders up to a range of THB41.40-THB41.45, from around THB41.20 earlier in the day. \par \par \uc2  Kobthip Teeravichitchainan, a dealer at Thai Farmers Bank PCL, said offshore investors were setting up long-dollar positions with borrowed baht in early trade, betting on a further decline in the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's value. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said they didn't see the dollar heading much higher than THB42 or THB42.50, however, before recovering with a return of short-term funds in the first quarter of next year. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's early upward move Tuesday came after \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Deputy Governor Tanya Sirivedhin said late the previous evening that a range of THB41-THB42 would be acceptable. \par \par \uc2  She said the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Friday near the dollar's 13-month high of THB41.41. \par \par \uc2  The purpose of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was to keep the baht from moving too far, too fast, but was not due to any objection to the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's level, Tanya said. \par \par \uc2  She left open the possibility that authorities would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the baht became unacceptably weak, but wouldn't be more specific. \par \par \uc2  -By Thomas Fox; 662-266-0744; tom.fox@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 28-09-99 \par \par \uc2  0551GMT \par \par \uc2  1028 1861 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv9s072u0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
