\par\par \b \uc2  Thai Ctrl Bk Gov/Baht -2: To Buy Baht If Prices Unstable \b0\par\par\uc2 257 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 September 1999\par 19:39\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WASHINGTON (Dow Jones)--It is inappropriate to call the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's entry into \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets Friday an act of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Chatu Mongol Sonakul said Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Speaking on the sidelines of the annual meetings of the World Bank and the International Monetary Fund in Washington, Chatu Mongol told Dow Jones Newswires that recent purchases of baht were "not really" \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  because they were of a "very little" amount and aimed at containing volatility, rather than at boosting the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "\b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is when you decide that a certain exchange rate is not right for you and then you \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to make it go up or down," Chatu Mongol said. "We didn't do that." \par \par \uc2  "We saw the baht moving up and down rather fast, so we just slowed it down a little bit. It worked very well," he said. \par \par \uc2  Chatu Mongol said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is finding application of a new flexible inflation-targeting model - based on a combination of indicators - "rather difficult to do," and for that reason it would continue to monitor changes in "various \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and oil prices" for measures of price stability. In that context, he indicated that the government might yet act to strengthen the baht if it weakens too much. \par \par \uc2  "If it seems to us that the situation is unsustainable, we might actually do something. But we are in that status at the moment," Mongkul said. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 28-09-99 \par \par \uc2  1739GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv9s06zk6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
