\par\par \b \uc2  Chatu Mongol: Phatra Thankit Action To Be Ctrl Bk's Last \b0\par\par\uc2 390 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 September 1999\par 18:26\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WASHINGTON (Dow Jones)--The Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's recent \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  into the management of ailing financial concern Phatra Thanakit PCL (H.PTK) will be its last such \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  into the country's bad debt-ridden banking sector, Bank of Thailand Governor Chatu Mongol Sonakul predicted Sunday. \par \par \uc2  Speaking at a conference sponsored by the Institute of International Finance, Chatu Mongol said the ratio of non-performing loans at Thai banks will "come down dramatically in the next two to three months." \par \par \uc2  He said negotiations between creditors and debtors set to conclude in coming months will lead to a vast improvement in banks' balance sheets. \par \par \uc2  The improvement means "we expect Phatra Thanakit this week to be our last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Chatu said. \par \par \uc2  The bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced last week a planned 4.4 billion-baht ($1=THB41.215) capital injection into Phatra Thanakit, which is wholly owned by Thai Farmers Bank PCL (H.TFB). \par \par \uc2  Thai Farmers Bank's planned THB24 billion rights issue has been delayed as a result of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's move. \par \par \uc2  Under the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's plan, THB7 billion in performing loans will be transferred to Thai Farmers Bank, while the remaining THB40 billion in nonperforming loans will be managed by an asset management firm owned by the Thai Farmers Bank. \par \par \uc2  Separately, Chatu said restrictions on offshore trading in countries' \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  have proved effective in Southeast Asia. \par \par \uc2  While he stressed that a free floating \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  regime is the best policy for the Thai baht, Chatu said such "soft capital controls" on offshore trading are "a prerequisite" to stability in Asian markets. \par \par \uc2  He also said that Thailand has a "contingency plan" in place for dealing with the effects of a possible devaluation in the Chinese yuan, but he declined to disclose details. \par \par \uc2  "The real test" of Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  stability "does not depend on dollars and yen. No, the real test will come if China devalues," he said. \par \par \uc2  "We have a contingency plan if China devalues, but I don't have enough time to talk about it, or I guess it's not such a good idea" to discuss it, he said. \par \par \uc2  The IIF conference took place on the sidelines of the annual meetings of the International Monetary Fund and World Bank. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 26-09-99 \par \par \uc2  1626GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv9q07362\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
