\par\par \b \uc2  Thai baht dips early on offshore dollar buying. \b0\par\par\uc2 582 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 September 1999\par 05:52\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  0240 GMT - The baht weakens against the dollar on offshore buying of the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  by Thai corporates \par \par \uc2  * Baht 40.53/40.58 per dlr vs 40.40/40.45 late Wednesday \par \par \uc2  * Baht 42.3376/42.4305 per euro vs 42.4402/42.5130 \par \par \uc2  * Y 103.82/103.87 per dlr vs 104.45/104.49 \par \par \uc2  * Overnight interbank rate at 1.125-1.25 pct \par \par \uc2  * One-month forward swap discounts at -10.00/-9.00 satangs onshore; -2.50/-0.50 satangs offshore \par \par \uc2  * \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's one-day repurchase rate at 0.75 pct. \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK, Sept 23 (Reuters) - Thai baht dropped further against the dollar early on Thursday as Thai corporates and players continued to buy the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  onshore and overseas, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The unit hit 40.55 to the dollar in early Asian trade. Some traders said they saw the baht go as 40.60 to the greenback in the U.S. market on Wednesday night, a level it last hit on September 21 last year. \par \par \uc2  "There had been series of attacks on the baht that drove the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  down to 39.50 from 37.50 a few weeks ago. The recent decline to 40.50 could be another round," said a dealer at a major European bank. \par \par \uc2  But Satian Tantanasarit, senior vice president for Treasury at DBS Thai Danu Bank, said he believed the baht had not been speculatively attacked. \par \par \uc2  "I firmly believe this," he told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  The baht was testing first support at 40.55 to 40.60 in morning trade and the second support is seen at 40.80. Resistance is expected at 40.40. \par \par \uc2  "Demand for the dollar increased dramatically on the need to settle debts by Thai corporates, including a small Thai commercial bank," said the first dealer. \par \par \uc2  At 0314 GMT, the relative strength index (RSI) of the dollar/baht exchange rate stood at 90.508, suggesting a highly overbought dollar condition as any level beyond 70 suggests overbuying and below 30 overselling. \par \par \uc2  The baht was quoted at 40.57 to 40.61 to the dollar onshore. \par \par \uc2  There was no market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  at any stage, traders said. \par \par \uc2  "I really think it's the time for the government to come into the market. The baht shouldn't go down any further," said a trader at a major Thai bank. \par \par \uc2  Arparporn Sawaengpak, deputy vice president of Nava Vickers Ballas Securities in Bangkok, expressed the view that the baht value at about 40 to 42 to the dollar was still "acceptable". \par \par \uc2  "The weakened baht will help exports, which are the key to an economic recovery," Arparporn said, though she admitted Thai corporates would suffer \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  losses. \par \par \uc2  "But the current situation suggests the economic recovery might not be as bullish as we initially projected," she said. \par \par \uc2  Gross domestic product (GDP) growth in the second quarter of this year was also lower-than-expected at 3.5 percent year-on-year, said the National Economic and Social development Board. \par \par \uc2  Media reports had quoted Finance Minister Tarrin Nimmanahaeminda as saying the GDP could have expanded as much as eight percent year on year in the second quarter. \par \par \uc2  The government projects a GDP growth of four percent for this year. \par \par \uc2  Nava Vickers Ballas estimates a GDP growth of 2.8 percent, according to Arparporn. \par \par \uc2  ((Ekarin Petsiri, Bangkok Newsroom +66-2 637 5500 ext 417 \par \par \uc2  e-mail:bangkok.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010909dv9n03aoa\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
