\par\par \b \uc2  Thai Ctrl Bk/Baht -3: Govt Unconcerned About Weaker Baht \b0\par\par\uc2 345 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 September 1999\par 13:51\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  "We found no unusual movement or unusual trading volume, neither in terms of bids or offers," he said. \par \par \uc2  Thirachai added, however, that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would continue to closely monitor activity in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  At 1133 GMT (7:33 a.m. EDT), the dollar was at Y103.87, down from over Y120 only several weeks ago. \par \par \uc2  The decline of the baht and the appreciation of the yen in recent weeks are making yen loans more and more expensive to service in baht terms, despite generally lower interest rates than baht loans or dollar-denominated loans. \par \par \uc2  Satian Tantanasarit, a senior vice president in DBS Thai Danu Bank PCL's treasury department, said earlier that he expects the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  early in Asian trade Friday if the dollar climbs to a range of THB40.25 to THB40.50. \par \par \uc2  However, Satian said he expects profit-taking soon. When it comes, whether Friday or next week, he doesn't expect investors to start building up new long-dollar positions until the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  corrects to around THB39.50. \par \par \uc2  In general, analysts believe Thailand's strong trade surplus and direct investment inflows will be sufficient to balance outflows to pay down foreign debts. \par \par \uc2  Deputy Finance Minister Pisit Leeahtam said Thursday morning that the government wasn't concerned by the prospect of the baht weakening past THB40 to the dollar, as the move is in line with the depreciation of other Southeast Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The baht, the Philippine peso, and to a lesser extent, the Singapore dollar, have recently followed the Indonesian rupiah lower on contagion from violence in East Timor. \par \par \uc2  Dealers noted that despite stability in the rupiah Thursday, sentiment was very negative, with the president and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  implicated in a banking scandal, and a high probability of complications upon entry as early as this weekend of a U.N. peacekeeping force into Timor. \par \par \uc2  -By Thomas Fox; 662-266-0744; tfox@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 16-09-99 \par \par \uc2  1151GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv9g06tpv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
