\par\par \b \uc2  Thai baht hits fresh 11-mth low on offshore sales. \b0\par\par\uc2 351 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 September 1999\par 05:07\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0208 GMT - Thai baht\tab   slips to fresh 11-month low early on Thursday after recent heavy sales of the unit in the New York market\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par * Baht 39.60/39.65 per dlr early vs 39.34/39.39 late Wednesday after hitting low of 39.70\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  * Baht 42.0037/42.0647 per euro vs 41.6008/41.6734 \par \par \uc2  * Y 109.11/109.16 per dlr vs 110.89/110.98 \par \par \uc2  * One-month forward swap discounts quoted at -10.50/-9.50 satangs per dlr onshore; 5.00/8.00 offshore \par \par \uc2  * \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  one-day repurchase rate 0.75 percent. \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK, Sept 9 (Reuters) - The baht weakened further to the lowest since Sept 23 last year after players heavily sold the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the New York market, which drove it to an intraday low of 39.70 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Dealers see the baht falling further as players have been cautious" about southeast Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which have been hard hit by social unrest in East Timor and its implications for Indonesia. \par \par \uc2  "The baht will move in a wide range (on Thursday). Support is seen at 39.70 to 39.75 and resistance at 39.50 to the dollar," said a dealer at a European bank in Bangkok. \par \par \uc2  He added that the baht could head for 40.00 per dollar either on Thursday or Friday. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  could have been boosted by the good news about the unexpected rise in Japan's April-June gross domestic product. \par \par \uc2  But the anxiety over East Timor and the offloading of rupiah by players would continue to plague the baht and the Phillipines peso. \par \par \uc2  "The rupiah is the main pressure on the baht and it would keep on moving the market," the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah could break through the 9,000 significant barrier on Thursday, he added. \par \par \uc2  Dealers in Bangkok have said they still see no sign of market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  ((Ekarin Petsiri +66-2 637 5500 ext 417 \par \par \uc2  email:bangkok.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv9900vvb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
