\par\par \b \uc2  Thai Fin Min-2:No Weak Baht Policy, No Strong Baht Policy \b0\par\par\uc2 335 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 September 1999\par 09:33\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK (Dow Jones)--Thai Finance Minister Tarrin Nimmanhaeminda denied Wednesday a report that he had spoken late the previous day in support of a weak baht policy. \par \par \uc2  "The reporter reported it wrong," Tarrin said in response to a question about the report after a speech to the Federation of Thai Industries Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  "Any report that I have changed policy on the baht is inaccurate," he said. \par \par \uc2  Tarrin and the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  have often reiterated that authorities \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets only to damp volatility, not to fight market trends. \par \par \uc2  "If there is any unusual fluctuation of the baht, the Bank of Thailand will monitor it closely," he said. \par \par \uc2  He refused to say whether Wednesday's moves were unusual or not, or whether authorities were \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  A report by an international news agency on Tarrin's comments late Tuesday cited the Finance Minister as saying the government was trying to keep the baht weaker in order to increase export competitiveness. \par \par \uc2  The report was cited as one factor in a sharp drop in the baht to a low of THB39.43 to the dollar Wednesday, from an Asian close of THB38.875 Tuesday, although dealers said the main factor was fear of contagion from the Timor crisis. \par \par \uc2  Following his denial, the dollar quickly dropped from the high to less than THB39.30. \par \par \uc2  Tarrin said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was closely monitoring trade, and that the baht was moving in line with market forces. \par \par \uc2  He wouldn't specify what the government might see as an appropriate range for the baht. \par \par \uc2  Tarrin repeated to reporters on the sidelines of the seminar Wednesday that he never said he supported a weak baht policy. \par \par \uc2  "We don't have a specific policy to a particularly strong baht. Neither do we have a policy to support a particularly weak baht," he said. \par \par \uc2  -By Sinfah Tunsarawuth; 662-266-0744; stunsarawuth@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 08-09-99 \par \par \uc2  0733GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv9806k30\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
