\par\par \b \uc2  Thai baht slips to near 11-month-low on yen slide. \b0\par\par\uc2 354 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 September 1999\par 11:44\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0857 GMT - Thai baht\tab   near 11-month low as the yen falls sharply\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par * Baht 38.93/38.96 per dlr early vs 38.75/38.80 in early Tuesday trade\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  * Baht 110.78/110.88 per yen vs 109.66/109.69. \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK, Sept 7 (Reuters) - The Thai baht slid to an 11-month low in line with the rupiah, other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the yen's declines on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  At 0904 GMT, the baht was quoted at 38.92/38.95 to the dollar, its lowest level since October 5 last year. The yen fell to 110.85/110.89 to the dollar from 109.66/109.69 in early Asian trade. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said there was also concern in the market that Japan's gross domestic product (GDP) to be announced on Thursday may not be as good as initially predicted. \par \par \uc2  A \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  analyst in Singapore said the baht was affected by spillover from the rupiah's plunge on East Timor worries. \par \par \uc2  These factors, combined with poor sentiment in the baht, led to a new round of dollar buying against the Thai unit. \par \par \uc2  "The East Timor problem has emerged as a threat to the region. It seems regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  were all affected," said the analyst. \par \par \uc2  "Players are building long dollar positions again after adjusting positions in the past few days," she said. \par \par \uc2  A dealer in Bangkok said he saw no sign of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  to shore up the baht. \par \par \uc2  At 0922 GMT, the baht rebounded slightly to 38.89/38.93 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Most dealers saw the baht heading past the 39 per dollar level in the near term. "If the baht breaks through the 39.90 support decisively, it could go to 39 per dollar," said a trader at a local bank. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Friday the baht had been undervalued and its real value should be around 33 baht to the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  ((Ekarin Petsiri +66-2 637 5500 ext 417 \par \par \uc2  email:bangkok.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv97014bd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
