\par\par \b \uc2  Thai Ctrl Bk/Baht -3: Slow Debt Workouts A Concern \b0\par\par\uc2 251 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 September 1999\par 07:26\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Chatu Mongol said investors felt insecure about domestic politics, so they didn't want to hold the baht. \par \par \uc2  The political opposition has been calling for Prime Minister Chuan Leekpai to dissolve the parliament and call a fresh election before his term ends in November next year. \par \par \uc2  Investors are also concerned about the slow restructuring of problem loans, which currently total about half of all outstanding loans in Thailand's financial system, he said. \par \par \uc2  Bank of Thailand has been helping the financial sector reach agreements on multi-creditor debt restructuring involving large bad loans. \par \par \uc2  "I don't believe that external factors have great impact on the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Chatu Mongol said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  prefers the baht to move in a narrow range according to market forces, rather than to stand still, he added. The bank has said it will only \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to stem speculative attacks. \par \par \uc2  Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's governor noted Thai companies were showing more confidence in the stability of the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  by hedging fewer of their foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  obligations than during the period after the de facto devaluation of the baht July 2, 1997. \par \par \uc2  Currently, there is $17 billion in forward foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  contracts, he said, without giving a comparative figure. Forward contracts lock in a price for buying foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the future at current prices. \par \par \uc2  -By Sinfah Tunsarawuth; 662 266 0744; stunsarawuth@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 02-09-99 \par \par \uc2  0526GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv9206jvo\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
