\par\par \b \uc2  Thai Ctrl Bk Chief -3: Exporters Will Cap Dollar's Rise \b0\par\par\uc2 277 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 August 1999\par 18:06\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  The dollar's recent rise against the baht isn't a worry because local exporters are coming into the market to sell the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  at the higher levels, Chatu Mongol said. \par \par \uc2  He reiterated the Bank of Thailand's policy to let market forces dictate the baht's level, with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  only acting in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to stem the activity of speculative traders. \par \par \uc2  "We manage the deliberate speculation," he said. "We haven't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  (in the baht's trend) at all." \par \par \uc2  On \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's banking sector, Chatu Mongol said private banks still need about THB140 billion to THB200 billion in fresh capital to be able to absorb losses from their huge problem loans. \par \par \uc2  That figure is based on the assumption that problem loans, which total about half of all outstanding lending in the system, don't get any worse. Ratings agencies, which use conservative debt figures, estimate banks need over THB400 billion in fresh capital. \par \par \uc2  Chatu Mongol said those banks that raise capital sooner rather than later - such as Thai Farmers Bank PCL (H.TFB) which raised THB24 billion in a rights issue this month - will benefit by being in a position earlier to extend new loans and gain a greater market share. \par \par \uc2  "They'll be ready earlier to make a run for it when the economy gets better," he said. \par \par \uc2  Bankok Bank PCL (H.BBK), the country's largest commercial lender, has told local newspapers that it doesn't need fresh capital to fully meet \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  requirements on bad loan provisions. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 25-08-99 \par \par \uc2  1606GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv8p068a0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
