\par\par \b \uc2  Thai Baht Dn Midmorning In Line With Regional  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 339 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 August 1999\par 06:17\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK (Dow Jones)--The Thai baht is weaker against the dollar in Asian spot trading midmorning Wednesday in line with the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's moves against other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  At 0354 GMT (11:54 p.m. Tuesday EDT), the dollar was at 37.895 baht, up from THB37.78 at the close, and a weighted average Tuesday of THB37.817. \par \par \uc2  A dealer at a foreign bank said Wednesday's range should be THB37.85-.95 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  A test of THB38 will be more difficult, because of fears of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but dealers said it was unlikely that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would actually start to sell down its foreign reserves at this point. \par \par \uc2  "Depreciation of the baht might actually be good for the country," boosting export competitiveness, a dealer said. \par \par \uc2  A sharp depreciation isn't expected, however, as there are signs that the Thai economy is recovering, and the current account remains in surplus. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said U.S. names based in Singapore were behind the dollar-buying, and that they may just be chasing the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  up to take profit later. \par \par \uc2  The baht has been trading at three-month lows recently, because of tensions between China and Taiwan, expectations of a yuan devaluation next year and the possibility of a hike in U.S. interest rates later in the month. \par \par \uc2  A business stimulus package passed by the cabinet Tuesday isn't affecting markets immediately, but is expected to provide a boost to the private sector in the longer term. \par \par \uc2  An auction of the commercial loans of closed finance companies taking place Wednesday is having no effect on the market, because there is limited interest in the poor-quality assets on sale. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is also higher Wednesday against the Singapore dollar, the Philippine peso and the Indonesian rupiah. \par \par \uc2  -By Thomas Fox; 662 266 0744; tfox@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 11-08-99 \par \par \uc2  0417GMT \par \par \uc2  1028 1861 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv8b05yo5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
