\par\par \b \uc2  ASIA  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2  - Regionals steady and calm pre-FOMC. \b0\par\par\uc2 606 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Juni 1999\par 11:14\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      0900 GMT - Asian regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  were steady and \par \par \uc2  trading calmly ahead of the result of the FOMC meeting, a \par \par \uc2  get-together which has transfixed the markets for days. \par \par \uc2      The vast majority of analysts see a 25 basis point \par \par \uc2  tightening in the Fed funds target rate of 4.75 percent but \par \par \uc2  there has been growing speculation that more rises might be in \par \par \uc2  the pipeline. \par \par \uc2  A modest 25 basis point is unlikely to have much impact as \par \par \uc2  it is already factored in, but if the Fed hints at more \par \par \uc2  tightening to come then a U.S. asset market and dollar reaction \par \par \uc2  is likely. \par \par \uc2      Assuming 25 basis points analysts say what the Fed say \par \par \uc2  might well be more important than what they do. \par \par \uc2      *** The South Korean won was slightly easier with the \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  again in the market buying dollars. Dealers reckon \par \par \uc2  they bought about $100 million. \par \par \uc2      Dealers said while verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the authorities \par \par \uc2  had worked in the past it would not continue to do so. Any \par \par \uc2  jawboning has to be backed up with hard cash for it to work. \par \par \uc2      Good industrial output figures had little impact. \par \par \uc2      May output showed the highest monthly year-on-year rise in \par \par \uc2  nearly 11 years. It rose 21.8 percent from a year earlier, the \par \par \uc2  highest monthly growth since August 1988 when it rose 29.7 \par \par \uc2  percent. \par \par \uc2      *** \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  reaffirmed its policy of not \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to influence the baht. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Chatu Mongol Sonakul said he believed \par \par \uc2  the baht's current rate at around 36.60-36.80 was backed by \par \par \uc2  sound fundamentals. \par \par \uc2      Deputy Prime Minister Supachai Panitchpakdi said last week \par \par \uc2  that the baht's strength could hurt exports if its rallies were \par \par \uc2  not checked. \par \par \uc2      *** End month commercial demand for dollars helped the \par \par \uc2  Taiwan dollar slightly higher. \par \par \uc2      Taiwan's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor defended the bank's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign \b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2  exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy, saying it only defended the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  when "irregular or seasonal factors" emerge. \par \par \uc2      "The exchange rate of the New Taiwan dollar, except for \par \par \uc2  cases where irregular or seasonal factors are present, is \par \par \uc2  determined by the market," said \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Perng \par \par \uc2  Fai-nan. \par \par \uc2  Although gains on the Taiwan dollar against U.S. dollar \par \par \uc2  have been meagre since the start of Monday, dealers said the \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  appeared to have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  *** The peso was barely changed with the market still \par \par \uc2  pondering the news of a two-percentage point cut in banks' \par \par \uc2  reserve requirements from July 2. \par \par \uc2  The move is expected to release over 20 billion pesos into \par \par \uc2  the system and the injection of liquidity should weaken the \par \par \uc2  local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCIES\b0 \highlight\uc2  VS U.S. DOLLAR \par \par \uc2  Change on the day TUE 29 0900GMT \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ...Latest bid....Prev Close....Pct Move \par \par \uc2   Ringgit......3.7995.......3.8000.........0.01% \par \par \uc2   Rupiah......6640.00......6620.00........-0.30% \par \par \uc2   Baht..........36.90........36.85........-0.14% \par \par \uc2   Peso..........37.96........37.94........-0.05% \par \par \uc2   Sing dlr.....1.7043.......1.7033........-0.06% \par \par \uc2   Taiwan dlr...32.280.......32.350.........0.22% \par \par \uc2   Korean won..1157.00......1156.00........-0.09% \par \par \uc2   Japan yen....121.19.......121.19.........0.00% \par \par \uc2   Change since start of Asia crisis \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .....Latest......July '97......Pct Move \par \par \uc2   Ringgit......3.7995.......2.5200........-33.68% \par \par \uc2   Rupiah......6640.00......2432.00........-63.37% \par \par \uc2   Baht..........36.90........25.90........-29.81% \par \par \uc2   Peso..........37.96........26.50........-30.19% \par \par \uc2   Sing dlr.....1.7043.......1.4300........-16.09% \par \par \uc2   Taiwan dlr..32.2800......27.7500........-14.03% \par \par \uc2   Korean won..1157.00.......842.00........-27.23% \par \par \uc2   Japan yen....121.19.......114.40.........-5.60% \par \par \uc2      ((Asia \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  Desk (65) 870-3840;fax (65) 870-3787; email: \par \par \uc2  asia.\b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2 @reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv6t05gee\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
