\par\par \b \uc2  ASIA  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Regionals relaxed despite FOMC meeting. \b0\par\par\uc2 594 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Juni 1999\par 03:36\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      0115 GMT - Regionals held steady against the dollar on \par \par \uc2  Tuesday morning, with an overnight rally in U.S. assets not \par \par \uc2  having much of an impact yet. \par \par \uc2      But volumes were thin and range limited before the start of \par \par \uc2  the FOMC meeting, to be held on Tuesday and Wednesday. \par \par \uc2      U.S. traders seemed more relaxed, after last week's fears \par \par \uc2  the Fed may introduce tighter policy than the 25 basis point \par \par \uc2  rate hike the market had factored in. \par \par \uc2      *** \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  reaffirmed its policy of not \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to influence the baht. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Chatu Mongol Sonakul said he believed \par \par \uc2  the baht's current rate at around 36.60-36.80 was backed by \par \par \uc2  sound fundamentals. \par \par \uc2      Deputy Prime Minister Supachai Panitchpakdi said last week \par \par \uc2  that the baht's strength could hurt exports if its rallies were \par \par \uc2  not checked. \par \par \uc2      *** The South Korean won opened almost unchanged, with \par \par \uc2  players clearly cautious about government-directed \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2      The \b \highlight22\uc2 central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Korea \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Monday, and bought \par \par \uc2  about $100 million to $150 million before the market closed. \par \par \uc2   South Korea's planning and budget ministry said the cabinet \par \par \uc2  council approved a supplementary budget of 1.30 trillion won. \par \par \uc2      The second supplementary budget would raise this year's \par \par \uc2  total spending to 87.05 trillion won from 85.75 trillion won, \par \par \uc2  which included the first supplementary budget. \par \par \uc2      The 1999 total state budget was originally scaled at 84.94 \par \par \uc2  trillion won. \par \par \uc2      South Korea publishes industrial production and current \par \par \uc2  account data for May at 0300 GMT and 0400 GMT respectively. \par \par \uc2      Industrial production has been showing some strong gains in \par \par \uc2  recent months. In April it rose 17.1 pct yr/yr, and in March \par \par \uc2  18.4 pct. \par \par \uc2      *** Taiwan's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor defended the bank's \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy, saying it only defended the local \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  when "irregular or seasonal factors" emerge. \par \par \uc2      "The exchange rate of the New Taiwan dollar, except for \par \par \uc2  cases where irregular or seasonal factors are present, is \par \par \uc2  determined by the market," said \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Perng \par \par \uc2  Fai-nan. \par \par \uc2  Although gains on the Taiwan dollar against U.S. dollar \par \par \uc2  have been meagre since the start of Monday, dealers said the \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  appeared to have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Perng and other \par \par \uc2  officials declined to say whether it had. \par \par \uc2      Perng said local media reports that the bank would tighten \par \par \uc2  monetary policy were mistaken. \par \par \uc2      "I never said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would tighten its monetary \par \par \uc2  policy. I only said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might 'fine-tune' its \par \par \uc2  monetary policy, which does not necessarily mean tightening," \par \par \uc2  Perng said. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCIES\b0 \highlight\uc2  VS U.S. DOLLAR \par \par \uc2  Change on the day TUE 29 0123GMT \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ...Latest bid....Prev Close....Pct Move \par \par \uc2   Ringgit......3.7995.......3.8000.........0.01% \par \par \uc2   Rupiah......6610.00......6620.00.........0.15% \par \par \uc2   Baht..........36.87........36.85........-0.05% \par \par \uc2   Peso..........37.98........37.94........-0.11% \par \par \uc2   Sing dlr.....1.7051.......1.7033........-0.11% \par \par \uc2   Taiwan dlr...32.270.......32.350.........0.25% \par \par \uc2   Korean won..1154.50......1156.00.........0.13% \par \par \uc2   Japan yen....121.44.......121.19........-0.21% \par \par \uc2   Change since start of Asia crisis \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .....Latest......July '97......Pct Move \par \par \uc2   Ringgit......3.7995.......2.5200........-33.68% \par \par \uc2   Rupiah......6610.00......2432.00........-63.21% \par \par \uc2   Baht..........36.87........25.90........-29.75% \par \par \uc2   Peso..........37.98........26.50........-30.23% \par \par \uc2   Sing dlr.....1.7051.......1.4300........-16.13% \par \par \uc2   Taiwan dlr..32.2700......27.7500........-14.01% \par \par \uc2   Korean won..1154.50.......842.00........-27.07% \par \par \uc2   Japan yen....121.44.......114.40.........-5.80% \par \par \uc2      ((Asia \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  Desk (65) 870-3840;fax (65) 870-3787; email: \par \par \uc2  asia.\b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2 @reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv6t05ff1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
