\par\par \b \uc2  Thai PM says exports may suffer from stronger baht. \b0\par\par\uc2 251 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Juni 1999\par 05:14\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  HAT YAI, Thailand, June 23 (Reuters) - Thai Prime Minister Chuan Leekpai said on Wednesday the baht's strength reflected a return of confidence in the economy, but exports could suffer if the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  firmed too much. \par \par \uc2  "The baht has been steady lately, but the recent firmer tone reflects a return of confidence in the economy which is improving," he told reporters on the sidelines of an international rubber conference here. \par \par \uc2  The baht rallied sharply on Tuesday and hit a five month high late in the day after the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it would not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to restrain the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Dealers have said that the Indonesian rupiah's rally close to the 6,500 per dollar level had also helped baht sentiment. \par \par \uc2  The baht was quoted at around 36.60/36.65 by 0305 GMT, firmer than the 36.80-36.90 level earlier this week. Earlier on Wednesday the baht climbed as high as 36.49/36.54. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the market was keeping an eye on what the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might do next about the baht's surge. \par \par \uc2  Premier Chuan said: "However, the stronger baht will affect exports and the Bank of Thailand is monitoring that closely because we are now under a managed float system." \par \par \uc2  "However, I don't think the Bank of Thailand will do anything to the point of distorting the market because that will create problems later," he added. \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv6n05zlw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
