\par\par \b \uc2  Thai Ctrl Bk Reiterates  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Policy; Baht Rises \b0\par\par\uc2 201 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Juni 1999\par 12:34\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK (Dow Jones)--A Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  assistant governor Tuesday reiterated the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's policy of not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  against trends in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets. \par \par \uc2  Kiettisak Meecharoen told reporters that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will step in to try and stabilize the dollar-baht exchange rate, however, if it moves too much, too quickly. \par \par \uc2  The assistant governor said that when the Thai economy was weak, market forces led to a weaker baht. \par \par \uc2  But currently, Thailand's economy is showing renewed signs of strength, so the baht is strengthening despite low domestic interest rates, he said. \par \par \uc2  Foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders said investors took this as a nod of approval from the authorities to take the baht a few notches higher without fear of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The dollar fell in afternoon trading to finish Tuesday at 36.58 baht compared with THB36.88 at Monday's close in Bangkok. \par \par \uc2  Traders see the near-term range at THB36.50-THB36.70, with the baht headed gradually higher in coming months on stronger export growth, and continuing equity and direct investment inflows. \par \par \uc2  -By Thomas Fox; 662-266-0744; tfox@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 22-06-99 \par \par \uc2  1034GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv6m04taq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\pics