\par\par \b \uc2  ASIA  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Regionals barely firmer, rupiah upbeat. \b0\par\par\uc2 857 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Juni 1999\par 11:35\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2   0920 GMT - Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  were barely changed, except for \par \par \uc2  the Indonesian rupiah, as the Bank of Japan stayed away from \par \par \uc2  the dollar-yen market, allowing the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to edge higher. \par \par \uc2      Dealers said the yen drifted higher on exporter demand, but \par \par \uc2  few were willing to buy the yen aggressivly due to lingering \par \par \uc2  fears of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2      Japan's top financial diplomat Eisuke Sakakibara said \par \par \uc2  earlier that a weaker yen was acceptable if it were necessary \par \par \uc2  for the economy. \par \par \uc2      "What is of paramount importance is to ensure Japan's \par \par \uc2  economic recovery as soon as possible," he said. \par \par \uc2      But Finance Minister Kiichi Miyazawa later said that \par \par \uc2  Japan's recent \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets was a \par \par \uc2  message to the markets that a sharp rise in the yen, based on \par \par \uc2  expectations of a quick Japanese economic recovery would be \par \par \uc2  disruptive. \par \par \uc2      "It was not done with the aim of boosting Japan's economic \par \par \uc2  growth," he told a news conference. \par \par \uc2      Dealers in Tokyo said the market was little affected by \par \par \uc2  comments by BOJ governor Masaru Hayami, who said Japan's \par \par \uc2  monetary policy has started to have a big impact on helping the \par \par \uc2  economy. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par *** The Indonesian rupiah\tab   broke 7,000 against the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dollar early on Tuesday and was still trading the right side of\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par this level in late trade.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Ginandjar Kartasasmita said on Monday it was "just a matter\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par of time" before the rupiah hit 6,500, and the move would not\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par hurt the country's exports.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par IMF official Stanley Fischer had also said the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par still had room to appreciate and that it would not be an\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par immediate concern for the economy, a comment which encouraged\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Ginandjar had commented last week that the rupiah was\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par gaining too fast, but later said he was happy with the pace of\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par appreciation.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Analysts have said that while a firmer rupiah could allow\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par interest rates to be cut faster and would help settle\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Indonesia's corporate debt deadlock, there is also a chance it\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par could strangle the prospects of an export-led recovery.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par *** South Korea's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the local\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market to buy dollars at 1,158.0, dealers in Seoul\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     They said the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of Korea bought an estimated\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par $100 million to $150 million to raise the dollar against the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par won.     But the South Korean won\tab     still finished\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par stronger at 1,159.4, compared with Monday's close at 1,165.5.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Earlier, a finance ministry official had said it was\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par closely watching the dollar/yen's impact on the local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par market and was concerned about the won's strength against the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par yen.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par A weaker yen is seen as a disadvantage for Korean\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par export-manufacturers, as they directly compete with Japanese\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par counterparts who gain an advantage from a cheaper local\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .     *** Inflows of foreign capital for Taipei's\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par rallying stock markets boosted the Taiwan dollar\tab    .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Dealers said the market had ignored the yen's downtrend\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par since it had been orchestrated by the BOJ.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "Had the BOJ not \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , the yen would have risen just\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par like the Taiwan dollar. The fundamentals still support strong\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ," one dealer at a U.S. bank said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     *** The Thai baht\tab     firmed slightly after the Bank of\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Thailand\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  said it would not \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par market to restrain the baht and added that the current strength\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par of baht would not hurt Thai exports.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Assistant \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  governor Kiatisak Meechareon told\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par reporters the baht had strengthened due to growing confidence\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par on the part of foreign investors in the positive outlook for a\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Thai economic recovery.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "We will not do anything (to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par markets). The baht is changing only gradually against the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dollar. We do not see any major volatility in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ,"\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Kiatisak said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par *** Thai exports were up 8.43 percent in dollar terms from\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par a year ago in May, according to preliminary data from the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par customs department. The figures were more upbeat than earlier\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par estimates which said May exports were up about 6.5 percent\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par year-on-year.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Seperately, Deputy Prime Minister Supachai Panitchpakdi\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par announced that Thailand's manufacturing production index in May\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par stood about 6.0 percent higher year-on-year.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par      Change on the day TUE 22 0932GMT\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ...Latest bid....Prev Close....Pct Move\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Ringgit......3.7995.......3.8000.........0.01%\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Rupiah......6800.00......7100.00.........4.41%\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Baht..........36.55........36.86.........0.85%\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Peso..........37.79........37.90.........0.29%\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Sing dlr.....1.7040.......1.7080.........0.23%\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Taiwan dlr...32.310.......32.330.........0.06%\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Korean won..1158.00......1165.00.........0.60%\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Japan yen....121.73.......122.41.........0.56%\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Change since start of Asia crisis\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .....Latest......July '97......Pct Move\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Ringgit......3.7995.......2.5200........-33.68%\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Rupiah......6800.00......2432.00........-64.24%\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Baht..........36.55........25.90........-29.14%\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Peso..........37.79........26.50........-29.88%\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Sing dlr.....1.7040.......1.4300........-16.08%\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Taiwan dlr..32.3100......27.7500........-14.11%\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Korean won..1158.00.......842.00........-27.29%\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Japan yen....121.73.......114.40.........-6.02%\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ************************************************\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  - Asia \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Desk (65) 870-3840\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  - Email: asia.\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 @reuters.com.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 1999.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv6m05wqp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
