\par\par \b \uc2  Thai c.bank says no baht  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 309 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 April 1999\par 10:50\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BANGKOK, April 9 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor, Chatu Mongol Sonakul, said on Friday his bank has not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to support the weak baht. \par \par \uc2  The baht briefly slid past the key 38 per dollar level in early Friday dealings and has been hovering just below that level for most of the day. On Thursday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was quoted late at 37.79/37.80. \par \par \uc2  "We have not entered the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to guide the baht movement because it weakened only five to 10 satangs. I think no \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  should \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  (because of the small drop)," Chatu Mongol told reporters. \par \par \uc2  The governor said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market since the baht was at 35.80, which was some months ago. \par \par \uc2  He said baht weakness was psychological as there was market expectation that the baht should fall further to help Thai exporters. There has been a debate in past weeks in Thailand between the government and private businesses over whether the baht should be allowed to weaken to help sagging exports. \par \par \uc2  The government is not in favour of such a proposal and has said market forces should dictate the baht's level. \par \par \uc2  The governor reiterated his belief that a weaker baht would not likely help exports. He urged exporters to boost their competitiveness by improving productivity. \par \par \uc2  The baht hit its six-month low of 38.02 to the dollar briefly on Friday morning before bouncing back to trade at 37.96/38.00 in mid-afternoon. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the baht's setback was capped by Thai exporters taking profit by unwinding their dollar positions when the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  eased to about 38.00. \par \par \uc2  ((Bangkok Newsroom (662) 253-5000 Ext 410 \par \par \uc2  e-mail: rtrburo@ksc15.th.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dv49039z7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
