\par\par \b \uc2  Thai Ctrl Bk Says No  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  In  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Markets Monday \b0\par\par\uc2 231 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Januar 1999\par 08:41\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it has not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets despite the baht's fall against the dollar Monday in line with other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , on talk of devaluation of the Chinese yuan. \par \par \uc2  Bank of Thailand Assistant Governor Kiettisak Meecharoen told reporters that Thailand's economic policies are the ultimate support for the baht. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has not been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market," he said. \par \par \uc2  "The market sees that \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been implementing the right policies in trying to stimulate the economy with monetary and fiscal measures," he said. \par \par \uc2  The Thai government is planning a public sector deficit equivalent to 5% of gross domestic product in the fiscal year ending Sept. 30, and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  policies are keeping overnight interest rates in domestic money markets at less than 3%. \par \par \uc2  A report in a Beijing publication cited unnamed analysts as saying a devaluation would not be harmful to China, but Chinese officials have consistently promised a "stable yuan" policy through 1999. \par \par \uc2  At 0726 GMT (2:26 a.m. EST), the dollar was at 37.045 baht (THB), up from THB36.82 at the close in Bangkok on Friday, but off an early high Monday of THB37.10. \par \par \uc2  -By Sinfah Tunsarawuth; 662-266-0744; stunsarawuth@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 25-01-99 \par \par \uc2  0741GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv1p00kfj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
