\par\par \b \uc2  Thai c. bank says no  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  to support baht. \b0\par\par\uc2 233 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Januar 1999\par 09:37\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BANGKOK, Jan 25 (Reuters) - The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Monday it had not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support a sharply weaker baht which retreated in line with regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  amid jitters over an talk of a possible Chinese yuan devaluation. \par \par \uc2  Thai assistant \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Kiettisak Meecharoen told reporters: "I believe this morning most investors took long dollar positions, otherwise \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  would not have retreated throughout the region...the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  did not enter the market. It has not done anything." \par \par \uc2  The baht fell to a Monday morning low of around 37.10 to the dollar from a quotation of 36.87/36.93 late on Friday. \par \par \uc2  Kiettisak said the Bank of Thailand would track the baht's movement for one or two more days and monitor the impact from jitters over a possible yuan devaluation which, he said, had returned on Sunday. \par \par \uc2  The assistant governor said the yuan's direction is still unclear despite China's insistence it will not devalue the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The official said he saw no immediate need for China to devalue the yuan as the country still enjoyed export competitiveness and a trade surplus with most other countries. \par \par \uc2  He said Thailand's gradually improving economic fundamentals have helped cushion the baht against external volatility. \par \par \uc2  - Bangkok Newsroom (662) 253-5000 \par \par \uc2  - e-mail: bangkok.newsroom@reuters.com. \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dv1p05zem\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
