\par\par \b \uc2  Thai  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  says won't  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  in baht. \b0\par\par\uc2 216 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Januar 1999\par 09:23\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BANGKOK, Jan 20 (Reuters) - The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday reaffirmed its belief that market forces and economic fundamentals should dictate the value of the baht. \par \par \uc2  Its governor, Chatu Mongol Sonakul, told reporters the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to protect the value of the baht in the past seven months. \par \par \uc2  "In the past seven months since I came to office, the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  has not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market," he said. \par \par \uc2  "New economic theory seems to suggest that central banks and policy makers should not be too preoccupied with defending the value of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and should let it move in line with the economic fundamentals," he added. \par \par \uc2  Officials at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  have said that the bank has entered the market from time to time mostly to buy dollars to meet outstanding forward obligations rather than to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market. \par \par \uc2  But this has been disputed by some money market dealers who have in the past said that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stop the baht from sliding below a certain key level. \par \par \uc2  Usually \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  are secret and its officials can chose whether or not to publicly declare such actions. \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dv1k066oe\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
