\par\par \b \uc2  SE Asian  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2  -3: Bank Of Thailand Seen Buying US Dlrs \b0\par\par\uc2 283 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Dezember 1998\par 11:36\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  "Given the real effective exchange rate appreciation, and the fact that inflation is not an issue, there is some room for a gradual depreciation of the Singapore dollar," said Wu. \par \par \uc2  Late in Asia on Friday, the U.S. dollar was quoted at S$1.6502, up from S$1.6449 late the day before. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Thailand was also said by traders to be actively buying U.S. dollars on Friday, selling the baht (THB) to support the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  above the THB35.90 level. \par \par \uc2  "It's not a question of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to manipulate the market. For the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  it is more a matter of accumulating dollars as reserves against a rainy day," said the head of regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading at one U.S. bank known to act as an agent of the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Over the course of the previous week's trading, the Bank of Thailand said on Friday, its foreign reserves rose to $28.8 billion from $28.6 billion, while its net outstanding forward positions were reduced to $7.6 billion from $7.7 billion a week earlier. \par \par \uc2  Despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's presence in the market, many traders remain bullish on the baht. They expect the U.S. dollar to continue to sink lower, depressed by foreign fund inflows in the run-up to Financial Sector Restructuring Authority's auction of moribund finance companies assets, scheduled for Dec. 15. \par \par \uc2  Late in Asian trading the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was quoted at THB35.94, flat compared with its level late the previous day. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 04-12-98 \par \par \uc2  1036GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010917duc401shz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
