\par\par \b \uc2  ASIA  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2  - Regionals shed gains, peso slides. \b0\par\par\uc2 592 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Dezember 1998\par 10:36\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      0925 GMT - Asian regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  drifted lower as the \par \par \uc2  yen gave up the bulk of its gains after a U.S. investment house \par \par \uc2  came in to cover dollars it sold in the morning. \par \par \uc2      But the dollar's rise was limited by concerns about Latin \par \par \uc2  America and jittery U.S. stock prices. \par \par \uc2      The Dow was hurt by concerns over the situation in Brazil \par \par \uc2  where the stock market sank 8.8 percent. \par \par \uc2      *** The Korean won gained one percent on the day and \par \par \uc2  dealers are looking for a break of the 1,200 per dollar barrier \par \par \uc2  soon. \par \par \uc2      Dealers will watch the outcome of negotiations between \par \par \uc2  Korea and the IMF on the scheduled repayment of IMF aid loans. \par \par \uc2      The government, which is barred by the IMF from directly \par \par \uc2  stepping into the market, might seek an eased stance over \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in return for repaying the maturing loans. \par \par \uc2      *** The Taiwan dollar rose to eight-month highs, boosted by \par \par \uc2  the yen, but dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had short-covered \par \par \uc2  U.S. dollars to stabilise the Taiwan dollar before Saturday's \par \par \uc2  elections. \par \par \uc2  The three-way contest has in reality been a two-horse race \par \par \uc2  from the start, with polls showing incumbent Chen Shui-bian of \par \par \uc2  the opposition Democratic Progressive Party running neck and \par \par \uc2  neck with ruling Nationalist Party challenger Ma Ying-jeou. \par \par \uc2  *** The Thai baht was steady amid caution about possible \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar purchases after Thursday's apparent \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's improved outlook has generated a lot of demand \par \par \uc2  for baht, especially ahead of the December 15 auction of failed \par \par \uc2  finance firms' assets, worth over 370 billion baht. \par \par \uc2  The Financial Restructuring Authority said it would proceed \par \par \uc2  with the auction on schedule despite the resignation of FRA \par \par \uc2  Secretary General Vichit-Vadakan. \par \par \uc2  *** The Philippine peso reversed its recent gains, sliding \par \par \uc2  through the 39 per dollar level on speculation the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  was buying dollars. \par \par \uc2  Manila markets were hit by a sharp 11.2 percent \par \par \uc2  year-on-year rise in November inflation, well up from the 10.2 \par \par \uc2  percent seen in October. \par \par \uc2  It was the highest annual inflation recorded in a single \par \par \uc2  month during the year and brought the per month average for the \par \par \uc2  11 months to 9.7 percent. \par \par \uc2  *** A senior Malaysian Finance Ministry official said the \par \par \uc2  ringgit's fixed exchange rate at 3.80 per dollar is \par \par \uc2  "competitive and not overvalued". \par \par \uc2  Secretary General Aris Othman said the government expects \par \par \uc2  the economy to begin recording a positive annualised rate of \par \par \uc2  growth by the third quarter of 1999 at the latest, if external \par \par \uc2  demand remains stable or improves. \par \par \uc2      Change on the day \par \par \uc2   Change on the day FRI 04 0924GMT \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ...Latest bid....Prev Close....Pct Move \par \par \uc2   Ringgit......3.7997.......3.8000....