\par\par \b \uc2  ASIA  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2  - Regionals firmer with yen but quiet. \b0\par\par\uc2 648 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Dezember 1998\par 02:37\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      0030 GMT - The regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  were firmer in early \par \par \uc2  business alongside the higher yen but end week volume was \par \par \uc2  light. \par \par \uc2      The yen is benefiting from a softer dollar which is being \par \par \uc2  hurt by the Dow's slippage. The Dow is being hurt by concerns \par \par \uc2  over the situation in Brazil where the stock market sank 8.8 \par \par \uc2  percent. \par \par \uc2      A surprise round of European rate cuts had no real impact \par \par \uc2  in Asia. \par \par \uc2      *** Taiwan markets are likely to be quiet today with \par \par \uc2  investors taking a pace back ahead of Saturday's parliamentary, \par \par \uc2  mayoral and city council elections. \par \par \uc2      The three-way contest has in reality been a two-horse race \par \par \uc2  from the start, with polls showing incumbent Chen Shui-bian of \par \par \uc2  the opposition Democratic Progressive Party running neck and \par \par \uc2  neck with ruling Nationalist Party challenger Ma Ying-jeou. \par \par \uc2      *** The won got off to a flying start and has now put on \par \par \uc2  around eight percent since the middle of last month. \par \par \uc2      There is still speculation that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might step \par \par \uc2  in with actual or verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the authorities think \par \par \uc2  the won's rally will start to impact on exports. \par \par \uc2      *** The Thai baht was still firm but not making a lot of \par \par \uc2  headway after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's apparent dollar buying \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Thursday. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's improved outlook has generated a lot of demand \par \par \uc2  for baht, especially ahead of the December 15 auction of failed \par \par \uc2  finance firms' assets, worth over 370 billion baht. \par \par \uc2      Thai Foreign Minister Surin Pitsuwan's comment that a \par \par \uc2  dollar/baht rate of 34 to 35 was appropriate gave offshore \par \par \uc2  players yet another reason to dump dollars. \par \par \uc2      Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's dollar purchases seemed \par \par \uc2  aimed at steadying the baht and more of the same is expected \par \par \uc2  today. \par \par \uc2      *** The Philippine peso continues to sparkle, thanks to the \par \par \uc2  stronger yen and overseas workers' remittances. \par \par \uc2      Corporate dollar inflows from the recent sale of stakes in \par \par \uc2  Nestle Philippines and Philippine Long Distance Telephone are \par \par \uc2  also boosting the peso. \par \par \uc2      The World Bank yesterday approved loans worth a total of \par \par \uc2  $600 million for the Philippines, part of $1 billion in credits \par \par \uc2  promised by World Bank President James Wolfensohn earlier this \par \par \uc2  year. \par \par \uc2  The money will be used to strengthen the banking system, \par \par \uc2  help companies cope with credit shortages and ease poverty in \par \par \uc2  rural areas. \par \par \uc2  *** In Pakistan, S&P cut its long term foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  sovereign and senior unsecured rates to double C from triple C \par \par \uc2  minus. \par \par \uc2  The downgrade follows the government's having missed a \par \par \uc2  US$13 million interest payment due Nov. 30, 1998, on its US$300 \par \par \uc2  million FRN due 2001. The bond indenture allows for a 10-day \par \par \uc2  grace period. \par \par \uc2  Ratings in both the double-'C' and triple-'C' category \par \par \uc2  signal that an obligor is currently vulnerable and is dependent \par \par \uc2  on favorable external conditions to meet debt service. Obligors \par \par \uc2  rated double-'C' face imminent debt service problems. Change on \par \par \uc2  the day \par \par \uc2  Change on the day FRI 04 0134GMT \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ...Latest bid....Prev Close....Pct Move \par \par \uc2   Ringgit......3.7996.......3.8000.........0.01% \par \par \uc2   Rupiah......7400.00......7500.00.........1.35% \par \par \uc2   Baht..........35.87........35.91.........0.11% \par \par \uc2   Peso..........38.74........38.74.........0.00% \par \par \uc2   Sing dlr.....1.6445.......1.6445.........0.00% \par \par \uc2   Taiwan dlr...32.330.......32.360.........0.09% \par \par \uc2   Korean won..1215.00......1225.00.........0.82% \par \par \uc2   Japan yen....118.12.......118.64.........0.44% \par \par \uc2   Change since start of Asia crisis \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .....Latest......July '97......Pct Move \par \par \uc2   Ringgit......3.7996.......2.5200........-33.68% \par \par \uc2   Rupiah......7400.00......2432.00........-67.14% \par \par \uc2   Baht..........35.87........25.90........-27.79% \par \par \uc2   Peso..........38.74........26.50........-31.60% \par \par \uc2   Sing dlr.....1.6445.......1.4300........-13.04% \par \par \uc2   Taiwan dlr..32.3300......27.7500........-14.17% \par \par \uc2   Korean won..1215.00.......842.00........-30.70% \par \par \uc2   Japan yen....118.12.......114.40........-3.15% \par \par \uc2   - Asia \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  Desk (65) 870-3840 \par \par \uc2   - Email: asia.\b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2 @reuters.com. \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010926duc4032q3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picsca