\par\par \b \uc2  Thai baht firms vs dollar in thin early trade. \b0\par\par\uc2 328 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 November 1998\par 04:33\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  0245 GMT - The Thai baht makes further small gain against the dollar in thin early trade on Wednesday \par \par \uc2  * Baht at 36.13/36.17 per dollar early vs 36.17/36.22 late on Tuesday \par \par \uc2  * Baht retains steady to slight bullish tone as it approaches the key 36.00 per dollar mark \par \par \uc2  * Market speculates Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to slow baht's appreciation towards the 36.00 level \par \par \uc2  * Dollar/yen, dollar/mark seen more stable during Thursday's U.S. Thanksgiving holiday \par \par \uc2  * Exporters seen selling dollars on expectation it may ease further against baht \par \par \uc2  * Local banks quote overnight interbank rates steady at 3.50-4.00 percent. \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK, Nov 25 (Reuters) - The Thai baht firmed slightly against the dollar in thin early trade on Wednesday but its advance was restrained by market speculation that the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  might \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to slow baht gains, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  They attributed market sluggishness to Thursday's U.S. Thanksgiving holiday which should make dollar/yen and dollar/mark more stable. \par \par \uc2  "Exporters sold dollars at the opening but they halted later on speculation that the Bank of Thailand would probably enter the market later to slow the baht's advance," a dealer at Bank of Ayudhya Plc said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the belief the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may quietly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  was based on a recent decline in the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's forward dollar/baht swap obligations. The data is announced every Friday. \par \par \uc2  "Most people would try to square positions ahead of Thanksgiving. Major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  should not be volatile unless the Iraqi tension flares up again," a dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Locally one month forward swap premiums were quoted at a discount of 0.003 satangs per dollar. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Thailand's one day repurchase rate opened lower at 4.25 percent against 4.375 late on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  - Bangkok Newsroom (662) 253-5000 Ext 413 \par \par \uc2  - e-mail: rtrburo@ksc15.th.com. \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010926dubp03qhb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
