\par\par \b \uc2  Thai Baht Ends Down; Dollar Recoups Support At THB36.50 \b0\par\par\uc2 262 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 November 1998\par 12:32\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK (Dow Jones)--The Thai baht ended lower against the U.S. dollar for the first time in seven trading days in Asian spot trade as 36.50 baht (THB) remained a support for the dollar, local dealers said. \par \par \uc2  They said foreign banks bought the dollar as it dropped below THB36.50. \par \par \uc2  Some overseas traders said the Bank of Thailand has stepped in to prevent the dollar falling below the THB35.00 level. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials said they were trading in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the bank's own need to settle its forward \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  contracts. The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  has never publicly admitted it was \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market. \par \par \uc2  At the close, the dollar was at THB36.60, up from Thursday's close of THB36.42. The dollar had dropped to a low of THB36.36 during the intraday trade. \par \par \uc2  As of Friday, the baht has dropped 29.3% since the Thai government abandoned its fixed \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  system July 2, 1997. The baht is now hitting 12-month highs against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  The baht strength is being supported by capital inflows due to a current account surplus, foreign direct investment and asset sales. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Thailand set its reference rate at THB36.442 to the dollar Friday, down from THB36.575 Thursday. The reference rate is a weighted average of rates charged by Thai commercial banks in the previous trading day. It serves as a benchmark for domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 06-11-98 \par \par \uc2  1132GMT \par \par \uc2  1028 1861 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010917dub600xqd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
