\par\par \b \uc2  SE Asian  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2 : Baht, Peso Continue Rally Early \b0\par\par\uc2 250 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Oktober 1998\par 02:45\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE (Dow Jones)--Both the Thai baht and the Philippine peso have inched higher in early trading Friday in Southeast Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, although the Singapore dollar and the Indonesian rupiah have slipped back from levels seen late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Although the baht (THB) is quoted a touch higher, traders say activity in the market is minimal, with almost no business transacted early in the day. Nevertheless, many market players feel the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue to test higher against an ailing U.S. dollar. \par \par \uc2  "I am a natural (dollar) bear," said a baht trader at a U.S. bank in Singapore. "I think the dollar will probably go to THB36.50, and if it breaks that level, we will be looking at THB36.00 next." \par \par \uc2  At 0130 GMT (8:30 p.m. Thursday EST) the U.S. dollar was quoted at THB36.7600, a fraction lower than THB36.8050 late the day before. While \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  remains likely, any \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  action would be aimed merely at "smoothing out" rather than reversing the baht's rise, according to the trader. \par \par \uc2  The Philippine peso (PHP) has also strengthened in early trading, following the trend established over recent sessions, although at $21 million currently, trading volumes are thin. \par \par \uc2  Against the Philippine \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the U.S. dollar is currently quoted at PHP40.590, down from PHP40.790 at Thursday's close. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires  10-29-98 \par \par \uc2  2045EST \par \par \uc2  1136 4250 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020010916duau02hnu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
