\par\par \b \uc2  Thai baht weaker late on c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 346 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Oktober 1998\par 12:29\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  0910 GMT - The Thai baht edges down slightly late on Friday after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announces it has entered the market \par \par \uc2  * Baht at 37.95/38.00 per dollar versus 37.83/37.88 early on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  * Dealers said \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market sporadically to buy and sell dollars to stave off volatility \par \par \uc2  * Baht rise earlier in the day is bouyed by a surprise 25 bps cut in U.S. rates overnight \par \par \uc2  * Trade moderate as offshore parties in Singapore are inactive ahead of long weekend \par \par \uc2  * Overnight interbank rate steady. \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK, Oct 16 (Reuters) - The Thai baht edged down slightly and moved in a narrow range in late trade on Friday after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced it had entered the market to help stabilise the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The move is a boon for foreign investors but would curb speculative activities, they said. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has bought and sold (dollars). This is to prevent the baht's excessive or too fast rally and I would not like to use the word \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Chatu Mongol Sonakul said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers confirmed that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was in the market to buy and sell sporadically. \par \par \uc2  "But there are more dollars coming in after the London market's opening. The baht might moved up at a slower pace after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's announcement but the firmer tone is there," said a dealer at a major European bank. \par \par \uc2  The trade volume was moderate as players in Singapore were reluctant to open fresh positions ahead of a long weekend holiday, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The overnight interbank rate was steady at 4.00-4.50 percent while the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's one-day bond repurchase rate edged up slightly to 5.125 percent from 5.00 percent in the morning close. \par \par \uc2  One-month forward swap premiums were quoted at 1.00/1.75 satangs per dollar onshore and 2.5/4.5 satangs offshore. \par \par \uc2  - Bangkok newsroom (662) 253-5000 \par \par \uc2  - email:bangkok.newsroom@reuters.com. \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021113duag0214x\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (Thailand near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\